  "summary": "整数 x 的权重是按 Collatz 规则变为一所需步数；将 [lo,hi] 按权重和数值排序，返回第 k 个。",
  "insight": "递归计算 power(x)，用哈希表缓存中间结果；排序键为（权重, 数值）。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "权重相同时按数值升序",
    "区间端点都包含",
    "缓存一的权重为零"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "memoized-collatz-sort",
      "title": "记忆化权重排序",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "复用 Collatz 链上已经计算的后缀步数。",
      "steps": [
        "memo[1]=0，power(x)=1+power(x/2 或 3x+1)",
        "生成 lo 到 hi 的整数列表",
        "按 power、value 升序排序并返回索引 k-1"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(R log R+链长)",
        "space": "O(R+链上状态)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/memoized-collatz-sort/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/memoized-collatz-sort/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/memoized-collatz-sort/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
}
